===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[elementary]] [[particle]]}}

# {{physics}} [[fundamental particle]]; any of the [[subatomic particle]]s that does not consist of other, smaller particles; the [[gauge boson]]s, [[lepton]]s and [[quark]]s

